SUMMARY:Alumni Tailgate at Anderson
DESCRIPTION:You are cordially invited to connect with fellow Mars Hill alumni and parents for a special tailgate before the big football game against the Anderson Trojans. \nCome enjoy great food\, wonderful community\, and the company of MHU President Tracy Parkinson. \nEvent Details:\nDate: Saturday\, November 7\, 2026\nAddress: 431 Williamston Rd\, Anderson\, SC 29621\nTailgate Time: 2:00 PM – 4:00 PM\nKickoff: 4:00 PM\nFood & Drink: Box lunches and beverages will be proudly provided by Firehouse Subs.\nWhat to Bring: Please bring your own chair (BYOC) and dress in warm layers to stay comfortable as the sun goes down! \nFootball Game Ticketing Information:\nGame tickets are general admission. While you can purchase them at the stadium\, we highly recommend buying them in advance online through the Anderson University Trojans Athletics website. Once you enter the stadium\, just head over to the visitor’s side to find the Mars Hill crowd! \nRSVP Today:\nRSVP to Denise Samide (denise_samide@m​hu.edu) to let us know if you can make it so we can get an accurate head count for food.
URL:https://www.mhu.edu/event/alumni-tailgate-at-anderson/
LOCATION:Spero Financial Field at Melvin & Dollie Younts Stadium\, 431 Williamston Rd\, Anderson\, SC\, 29621\, United States
CATEGORIES:Alumni,Athletics,Featured,Football
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.mhu.edu/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/andtailgate.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="Alumni Relations":MAILTO:alumni@mhu.edu
END:VEVENT
