SUMMARY:MHU-Franklin Connects
DESCRIPTION:Calling all Franklin-area friends and alumni of Mars Hill University! Join us for food\, fun\, and fellowship. \nSchedule: \n\n11:30 a.m.: Tour of the MHU Campus Center\n12–1 pm: Tailgate in the parking lot of Ferguson Math and Science Center (across Athletic Street from Meares Stadium).\nLunch is provided. Bring your own chair. (Rain location: Blackwell Terrace of Ammons Field House)\n1 p.m.: Football game — MHU Lions vs. Wingate University Bulldogs\n(Reserved seating for the group.)\n\nHosted by: \n\nSuzanne & Jeff Wade\nKay & Ben Wax\nPaula & Rob Kahn\n\nRegister:
URL:https://www.mhu.edu/event/mhu-franklin-connects/
LOCATION:NC
CATEGORIES:Alumni
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.mhu.edu/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/franklinconnectsthumbnail.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="Alumni Relations":MAILTO:alumni@mhu.edu
END:VEVENT
