SUMMARY:Mars Hill First Fridays
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate First Friday 5–8 p.m. in downtown Mars Hill with live music\, dance\, shopping\, art\, food\, local businesses and more! Tag our Spotlight or @MarsHillFirstFriday on social media for a chance to win! \nHere’s what all’s happening\, let us know more and spread the word!\nMARS HILL FIRST FRIDAY HAPPENINGS 2026 \nFirst Fridays 5-8pm April thru December\nMars Hill\, North Carolina\nLink to more info\nFind us on social media!\nIG: @marshillfirstfriday FB: @marshillfirstfriday
URL:https://www.mhu.edu/event/mars-hill-first-fridays-9/
