SUMMARY:Baseball Night
DESCRIPTION:Join us for Baseball Night\, hosted by the 2026–2027 Mars Hill University baseball team on Saturday\, January 16\, 2027 from 6:00 to 8:00 PM. We are bringing the celebration to downtown Asheville at Hometrust Park. \nThis special evening is your chance to reconnect with fellow Lions and meet our coaches\, alumni\, and student-athletes\, while enjoying food and beverages in a unique baseball setting. Throughout the night\, you can participate in the silent auction\, exciting raffles\, and our live auction of premium items. \nTickets are $100 per person. All proceeds directly enhance the Mars Hill University student-athlete experience—giving our Lions the tools they need to thrive on the field\, in the classroom\, and beyond. \nDon’t miss this unforgettable night supporting the future of Mars Hill baseball! \nMark your calendars: Tickets go on sale Friday\, November 20\, 2026.
URL:https://www.mhu.edu/event/baseball-night-2/
LOCATION:McCormick Field\, 30 Buchanan Pl\, Asheville\, NC\, 28801\, United States
CATEGORIES:Alumni,Athletics,Baseball,Featured,Public Events
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.mhu.edu/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/baseball.jpg
END:VEVENT
